\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Turkey Central Bank \highlight\uc2  -3: Further  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Likely \b0\par\par\uc2 247 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 August 1998\par 13:27\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's third consecutive daily \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  this week was aimed at a faster lira depreciation as the Turkish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's daily depreciation fell below the bank's target. \par \par \uc2  At the time of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the lira's daily depreciation against a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket of $1 and DEM1.5 was around 0.03%. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  aims to keep the lira's daily depreciation at a range of 0.1%-0.12%. That way it would keep the lira's monthly depreciation in line with the monthly inflation rate. \par \par \uc2  In July, Turkish consumer and wholesale prices rose by 3.4% and 2.5% respectively. The government aims to keep the wholesale inflation for the third quarter of the year at 9.3%. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came relatively early Thursday, more than an hour before the market closes for the day. That may create a window of time for commercial banks to resume selling dollars, prompting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again. \par \par \uc2  "That means another wave of lira selling (by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) may come later today," said Ozgur Baha Pars, a trader at Finansbank in Istanbul. \par \par \uc2  Around 1150 GMT, offers of lira against the dollar in the interbank market were at TRL271,250, up from the market's opening at TRL270,850. \par \par \uc2  -By Burak Bekdil; +90 312 466 3101; bbekdil@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 06-08-98 \par \par \uc2  1127GMT \par \par \uc2  1169 1862 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8606n76\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
