 512 5017; satalay@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 25-03-98 \par \par \uc2  1054GMT \par \par \uc2  1169 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du3p02kcn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
