\par\par \b \uc2  Turkish Lira Dn Vs Dollar Midday; Depreciation At 0.15% \b0\par\par\uc2 255 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1998\par 10:03\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  ANKARA (Dow Jones)--The Turkish lira (TRL) is lower against the dollar midday Monday in line with the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar buying rate. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the lira's three-days depreciation rate against the dollar/Deutsche mark \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket is 0.45%. \par \par \uc2  Around 0956 GMT, dollar bids at the interbank market were at TRL239,230, up from Friday's close at TRL238,130. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Turkey's dollar buying rate for commercial banks' 14% minimum reserve requirements was at TRL239,210, with dollar rate at DEM1.8326 from Friday's close at TRL238,160 and DEM1.8331. \par \par \uc2  At 0956 GMT, the dollar was quoted at DEM1.8336, compared with DEM1.8300 around 0530 GMT in Tokyo and DEM1.8320 late Friday in New York. \par \par \uc2  Murat Erden, a dealer at Istanbul's Bankers Trust, said the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is calm with some dollar selling. \par \par \uc2  He said market calmed after seeing the government softening its stance over the friction with the military. \par \par \uc2  Prime Minister Mesut Yilmaz was at odds with the army last week over the military's strong stand against Islamic fundamentalism in \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  '\b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is unlikely unless stronger dollar selling pressure is felt,' Erden said. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  opened a seven-day repo auction to provide some liquidity to the lira-tight market. The market opened TRL85.1 trillion short. \par \par \uc2  -By Mike Zemene; +90 312 466 3101 \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 23-03-98 \par \par \uc2  0903GMT \par \par \uc2  1169 1862 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du3n02hqu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
