emption schedule in February and has to rely on the domestic market to roll its debt. \par \par \uc2  -By Selim Atalay; +90 212 512 5017; satalay@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 11-02-98 \par \par \uc2  0921GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du2b016a3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
