\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Turkey \highlight\uc2  Lira Down Vs Dollar Midday;  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Watch On \b0\par\par\uc2 245 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Februar 1998\par 11:09\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  ANKARA (Dow Jones)--The Turkish lira is lower against the dollar midday trading Friday in line with the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar buying rate. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the lira's daily depreciation rate against the dollar/Deutsche mark \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket is 0.25%. \par \par \uc2  Around 0940 GMT, dollar bids at the interbank market were at 219,790 lire (TRL), up from Thursday's close at TRL219,230. The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Turkey's dollar buying rate for commercial banks' 14% minimum reserve requirements were at TRL219,550, with dollar rate at DEM1.7938 from Thursday's close at TRL219,050 and DEM1.7918. \par \par \uc2  At 0940 GMT, the dollar was quoted at DEM1.7935, compared with DEM1.7885 around 0530 GMT in Tokyo and DEM1.7865 late Thursday in New York. \par \par \uc2  Timurcin Osmanagaoglu, a dealer at Istanbul's Iktisat Bankasi AS, said the monthly lira's depreciation rate is projected at 6.00% for February. \par \par \uc2  'The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  today to lower the lira's monthly deprecation projection,' he said. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, despite the dollar buying demand, there is still lira liquidity shortage in the market. The market opened TRL252.4 trillion short. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  opened a seven-day repo auction with an average\par 82.37% interest rate and sold TRL191 trillion lira to provide some\par liquidity to the market.\par -