\par trillion with an average interest rate of 80.39% to provide some\par liquidity to a lira-tight market.\par -By Mike Zemene; +90 312 466 3101\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 04-02-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1020GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1169 1862 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du2400xuh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
