hlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  might even lower (the) lira's monthly depreciation\par rate to 4% next year,' she said. The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is trying to keep a\par 5.25% monthly depreciation speed in December, down from its 6.10%-6.20%\par target in previous months.\par -By Mike Zemene; +90 312 466 3101\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 17-12-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0950GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1169 1862 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtch09oyb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
