\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Turkey \highlight\uc2 's Lira Up Vs Dlr;  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Watch On \b0\par\par\uc2 281 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Dezember 1997\par 10:48\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  ANKARA (AP-Dow Jones)--The Turkish lira is higher against the dollar midday Friday, but lower against the Deutsche mark, traders said. Traders said the lira's gains against the dollar reflected the dollar's recent weakness against the mark. \par \par \uc2  Traders said a weak \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is still possible, although the dollar buying demand has calmed after the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised its overnight lira lending rate to 82% from 80% on Thursday and keeps a lower daily lira depreciation speed. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the lira's daily depreciation speed against the dollar/Deutsche mark \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket is 0.16% for the day. \par \par \uc2  Around 0931 GMT, dollar bids at the dollar/lira interbank market were at 198,660 lira, down from Thursday's close at 198,900 lira. The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Turkey's dollar buying rate for commercial banks' 14% minimum reserve requirements were at 198,580 lira, with dollar parity at DM1.7667 from Thursday's close at 198,850 lira and DM1.7776 \par \par \uc2  At 0931 GMT, the dollar was quoted at DM1.7669, from DM1.7632 around 0545 GMT in Tokyo and DM1.7610 late Thursday in New York. \par \par \uc2  Mehmet Mazi, a trader at Istanbul's Midland Bank AS, said that he expects some banks to open dollar short positions in the coming weeks to invest in lira positions, if markets gain political and financial certainty. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Strong dollar buying demand has been felt recently after rumors of a\par possible election and the government's plan to impose tax on capital\par gains.\par -By Mike Zemene; +90 312 466 3101\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 12-12-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0948GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1169 1862 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtcc09jyi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
