tight market. The market opened 289.2\par trillion lira short.\par -By Mike Zemene; +90 312 466 3101\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 05-12-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1058GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1169 1862 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtc509d4o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
