\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Turkey \highlight\uc2 's Lira Lower Vs Dlr Late Morning,No  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 287 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 November 1997\par 11:33\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  ANKARA (AP-Dow Jones)--The Turkish lira is lower against the dollar in late morning trading Monday, in line with the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar buying rate. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the lira's three-day depreciation rate against the dollar/Deutsche mark \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket is at its regular 0.62%, with some dollar buying and selling seen in the morning session. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is not expected to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  as long as the current depreciation rate is maintained. The bank is known to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to reduce the lira's daily depreciation rate. \par \par \uc2  Around 0941 GMT, dollar bids at the dollar/lira interbank market were at 191,310 lira, up from Friday's close at 190,800 lira. The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Turkey's dollar buying rate for commercial banks' 14% minimum reserve requirements was at 191,250 lira, with dollar parity at DM1.7358, from Friday's close at 190,760 lira and DM1.7495. \par \par \uc2  At 0941 GMT, the dollar was quoted at DM1.7359, compared with DM1.7357 around 0545 GMT in Tokyo and DM1.7380 late Friday in New York. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  opened a seven-days repo tender on Monday to provide liquidity to the market, selling 65 trillion lira in the repo tender. Demand was low as traders found the average interest rate of 81.59% high. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Mutlu Akpara, a dealer at Yapi Kredi Bankasi AS, said the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par market was not affected by the government's plan to speed up its three\par year economic program to one year.\par -By Mike Zemene; +90 312 466 3101\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 24-11-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1033GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1169 1862 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtbo08y54\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
