\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Turkey \highlight\uc2  Lira Dn Vs Dlr; Mkt Calmer But  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Eyed \b0\par\par\uc2 303 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 November 1997\par 10:28\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  ISTANBUL (AP-Dow Jones)--The Turkish lira is trading lower against the dollar early Monday in line with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar buying rate. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the market is calmer than last week, but the dollar buying demand remains despite an equally strong lira shortage. Traders said the bank could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  and sell dollars if demand for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues. \par \par \uc2  Around 0856 GMT, dollar bids at the dollar/lira interbank market were at 183,750 lira, from Friday's close at 182,080 lira. The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Turkey's dollar buying rate for commercial banks' 14% minimum reserve requirements were at 183,720 lira, with dollar parity at DM1.7349 from Friday's close at 181,880 lira with parity at DM1.7248. The lira market is 152 trillion lira short. \par \par \uc2  Around 0856 GMT, the dollar was at DM1.7370, from DM1.7350 late Friday in New York and DM1.7253 in London Friday. \par \par \uc2  'Foreign dollar buying demand is still visible, although less extensive than last week,' said a trader with an Istanbul-based foreign bank. 'With the first sign of uneasiness, the demand will jump.' She cited relatively calmer bond and stock markets Monday morning. \par \par \uc2  Foreign-held bond and stock portfolios were being dumped last week and lira holdings converted into dollars. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Traders said the lira's daily depreciation is at 0.24% against the\par dollar/DM basket, and is high against the regular 0.16% to 0.20%.\par Traders said normally in a lira demanding market there should be dollar\par selling. They said a higher \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  buying rate might initiate some\par dollar selling.\par -By Selim Atalay; +90 212 512 5017; satalay@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 03-11-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0928GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1169 1862 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtb308cew\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
