dollar is bought by the bank for lira. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Another Istanbul-based trader said the speedy lira depreciation might\par indicate a high October inflation expectation.\par    -By Mike Zemene; +90 312 4663101\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 21-10-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0905GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1169 1862 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtal07vwv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
