\par\par \b \uc2  NO DEVALUATION, NO RATE  \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION \highlight\uc2 -TURK MINISTER. \b0\par\par\uc2 235 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Juli 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  ANKARA, July 7 (Reuter) - Gunes Taner, \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 's state minister for the treasury, said the new coalition government would not go for a one-off devaluation nor \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the interest rate policy. \par \par \uc2  "In our practice, there will not be two things -- a devaluation and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in interest rates," Taner told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  Taner said the government would manage the economy through "fine tuning". \par \par \uc2  "By saying fine tuning, I mean that there won't be big \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . To do this, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has some instruments such as open market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . We will run the economy by using these instruments," Taner said. \par \par \uc2  Turkey had last devalued its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in early 1994. \par \par \uc2  The republic has led its lira fluctuate in line with supply and demand in the market under the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's tight grip since then. \par \par \uc2  Taner hinted that the government may not continue to auction two-year, inflation-indexed bonds -- an instrument heavily used by the former Islamist-led government to raise funds from the domestic market in the past four months. \par \par \uc2  "TUFEX (inflation-indexed bonds) is not a type of borrowing model I prefer," he said. He did not give any further details. \par \par \uc2  The inflation-index bonds make up 15 percent of the domestic debt stock which stood at 4,026.8 trillion lira at end-May. \par \par \uc2  -- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-2750875. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt7702wb4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
