\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Turkey \highlight\uc2  Bank/Dlr -2: Market Suspects  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 267 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Mai 1997\par 15:05\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  ISTANBUL (AP-Dow Jones)--Dollar bids at the Turkish \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market fell sharply minutes before the closure Wednesday while some bankers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Turkey sold dollars for lira. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, some traders said heavy selling by a state bank might have caused the rate decline. Traders suspect at times, state banks are selling dollars on behalf of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to lower the market rate. Another group of traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could have been the anonymous seller at the trading screens. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't comment on \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , calling them routine \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb market volatility. \par \par \uc2  A trader said, shortly before the close, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  decreased its dollar buying rate to 139,750 lira from 139,800 lira, and this led to almost 150 lira falls at the commercial banks' bids. 'Normally, the market doesn't react this way,' said Yigit Ustay at Societe Generale Bank in Istanbul. 'It was as if an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came.' \par \par \uc2  At the time, commercial banks' best bids were at 140,000 lira and over. following the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's move, bids fell to 139,800 lira. \par \par \uc2  Some traders said minutes before the market's 1200 GMT close, lira overnight rates fell to 53% from the opening at 69% and the lira liquidity might have caused the confusion. \par \par \uc2  At the close, commercial banks' best bids were at the 140,000 lira range and the last quote at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 -controlled trading screen was at 139,980 lira. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 28-05-97 \par \par \uc2  1305GMT \par \par \uc2  1169 1862 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt5s03w99\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
