\par\par \b \uc2  Turkey's Lira Dn Vs Dlr; Rate Downgrade Disregarded \b0\par\par\uc2 288 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par 12:28\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  ISTANBUL (AP-Dow Jones)--The Turkish lira is stable against the dollar intraday Tuesday following Monday's dollar selling \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said. \par \par \uc2  They added that rate downgrading by Duff & Phelps Credit Rating Co. (DCR) announced late Monday had no effect on the market, partly that rate downgrades from various companies have been faced and anticipated for months. \par \par \uc2  Around 1100 GMT the dollar bids at the dollar/lira interbank market were at 124,720 lira, slightly above than Monday's close at 124,700 lira. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar buying rate for commercial banks' minimum reserves were at 124,550 lira, up from Monday's close at 124,450 lira. \par \par \uc2  Around 1100GMT, the dollar was at 1.7053 Deutsche banks, up from 1.7023marks and at 121.78 yen, up from 121.40 yen. \par \par \uc2  The market eyes the 1 year bond auction by the Turkish Treasury as bond traders said the turnout will be high and the treasury is likely to sell above its Wednesday repayment of 106 trillion lira. A high turnout is likely to create demand for the lira and raise the lira interest rates, a factor seen to curb any dollar buying demand. \par \par \uc2  Duff & Phelps Credit Rating Co. (DCR) said it has downgraded the rating of the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  obligations of the Republic of Turkey from BB (Double-B) to BB- (Double-B-Minus). DCR revised Turkey's rating outlook from negative to stable, and the rating was removed from Rating Watch--Down. \par \par \uc2  'This downgrade is the result of the accumulation of negative macroeconomic trends,' DCR added. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 11-03-97 \par \par \uc2  1128GMT \par \par \uc2  1169 1862 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt3b01pp6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
