\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Turkey \highlight\uc2 's Lira Dn Vs Dlr In A Tense Mkt;  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 345 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par 10:40\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  ISTANBUL (AP-Dow Jones)--The Turkish lira is lower against the dollar intraday Wednesday and following a regular course of depreciation despite the jittery markets, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Traders added that the overall market sentiment is getting bad to worse as the tension between the Islamist Prime Minister Necmettin Erbakan and the armed forces is moving to a collision course. \par \par \uc2  The market opened with a lira reserve of over 80 trillion lira and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  opened a reverse repurchase securities auction to draw off excess liquidity. \par \par \uc2  'If we can be sure that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , all of us would be lining up to buy dollars,' said a bank \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager. 'But we don't, because this will provoke a dollar selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .' \par \par \uc2  Around 1100 GMT, the dollar buying bids at the dollar/lira interbank market were at 124,020, up from Tuesday's post-\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  close at 123,700 lira. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar buying rate for commercial banks' reserve requirements were at 123,850 lira, up from Tuesday's 123,550 Lira. \par \par \uc2  Traders said with the dollar/mark cross, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar buying rate should be 123,900 lira, but they added that the bank is trying to curb the rate increase. \par \par \uc2  Given the negative market sentiment, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Turkey is seen ready to sell dollars at the slightest dollar buying demand and curp any speculative attack. \par \par \uc2  Following Tuesday's higher-than-expected inflation data, traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  must be pushing the lira's depreciation speed, but now isn't the right time. \par \par \uc2  Consumer prices rose a monthly 5.7% in February and were up 77.7% from February 1996. Wholesale prices rose 6.2% in February and were up 78.6% from a year earlier. Meanwhile, the lira's February depreciation against the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket of 1 dollar and 1.5 marks was at 4.2%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 05-03-97 \par \par \uc2  0940GMT \par \par \uc2  1169 1862 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt3501k02\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
