\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Turkey \highlight\uc2 / \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2 /Dollar -2: Second  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 295 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Februar 1997\par 15:17\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  ISTANBUL (AP-Dow Jones)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars for the lira Thursday shortly before the interbank market's 1300 GMT close, traders said. \par \par \uc2  They added that the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , second since Wednesday, was aggressive and broke any existing dollar buying demand in the market. \par \par \uc2  The bank started selling when the dollar rate was at 119,770 lira and rolled it back to 119,550 lira, lower than Thursday's intraday rate of 119,750 lira. \par \par \uc2  Traders were split about the reasons of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  as they said there was no visible buying demand at the time and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold even to banks with the lowest bids. \par \par \uc2  An Istanbul based trader said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is trying to convince the market that the lira's February depreciation against its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket of 1 dollar and 1.5 Deutsche marks will be 4%. 'They might continue selling Friday just to reiterate their power,' he added. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, another trader said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  can't go on selling dollars until the end of the month, and is likely to benefit from the lira squeeze in the market. \par \par \uc2  The lira overnight borrowing rate rose to 71% Thursday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , up from the earlier 68%. \par \par \uc2  The governor of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Gazi Ercel told the Turkish press Thursday that the dollar's international fluctuations are likely to continue and the dollar might reach to 1.70 marks towards the end of the year. Ercel said he prefers a more stable relationship between the dollar, the mark and the yen. \par \par \uc2  A trader said the market is more interested with the governor's year-end dollar/lira rate target. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-02-97 \par \par \uc2  1417GMT \par \par \uc2  1169 1862 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt2d012vk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
