\par\par \b \uc2  Turkey Bank/Dlrs -2: Inflation Data Higher Than Expected \b0\par\par\uc2 275 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Februar 1997\par 11:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came after the release of January inflation data as \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 's State Institute of Statistics announced early Tuesday that consumer prices rose by 5.9% in January and were up by 75.7% from January 1996. Wholesale prices, rose by 5.6% and were up by 78% in the 12 months through January, the statistics office said. \par \par \uc2  The data was higher than the market expectations of about 4% and banks started buying dollars. \par \par \uc2  A trader said following the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was settled. \par \par \uc2  He recalled last week's heavy dollar sales by foreign banks and added that the sale provided a considerable supply to the market. Last week foreign participants were seen to take positions at the Istanbul stock exchange and at the T-bill market. \par \par \uc2  'There won't be an overall dollar buying demand as long as these players remain in their positions,' said the trader. \par \par \uc2  The Istanbul Stock exchange closed the Tuesday morning session at 1518 points, down 57 points or 3.6% from Monday's close. \par \par \uc2  Participants see the treasury bill market as more vulnerable where a rate decline has been continuing since October 1996's 140% range. At intraday Tuesday, bills were at the 80% to 84% range, but no drastic move was seen. \par \par \uc2  The Turkish Treasury is holding a 287-day t-bill auction Tuesday. Participants said following the inflation data, bidding will be low. The treasury has to pay 52.1 trillion lira Wednesday for bills maturing from two previous auctions. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 04-02-97 \par \par \uc2  1020GMT \par \par \uc2  1169 1862 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt2400p8f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
