\par\par \b \uc2  Turkey Lira Dn Vs Dlr; Liquidity, Interest Spurs Demand \b0\par\par\uc2 283 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Januar 1997\par 10:43\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  ISTANBUL (AP-Dow Jones)--The Turkish lira is lower against the dollar Tuesday in a lira liquid market and low interest rates which normally should prompt dollar buying demand, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Despite the conditions, the market is relatively quiet at intraday trading and traders attribute this to the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  ability of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the dollar's gains in international markets. \par \par \uc2  Around 0925 GMT the dollar bids at the interbank market were at 111,885 lira, up from Monday's close at 111,550 lira. The central banks' dollar buying rate for commercial banks' minimum reserves was at 111,500 lira, up from Monday's 111,250 lira. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  market opened with a lira reserve of 45 trillion lira. \par \par \uc2  Around 0830 GMT, the dollar is quoted at 1.5885 marks, compared with 1.5884 marks late Monday in New York and 1.5912 marks around 0530 GMT in Tokyo. \par \par \uc2  Traders said it's surprising that the market is lira liquid a day before the government 85 trillion lira salary payments. \par \par \uc2  Some expect dollar buying demand from companies and individuals. Banks are seen to be more constrained in their dollar trading as transaction tax slashes already minimal profit margins and banks are the main target for \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  So far, the lira's depreciation rate against the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket of 1 dollar and 1.5 marks is close to 2.5% and it corresponds to a relatively high 5.5% depreciation for the month. Traders said depreciation might slow in the second half of the month. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 14-01-97 \par \par \uc2  0943GMT \par \par \uc2  1169 1862 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1e008ub\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
