\par\par \b \uc2  Turkey's Shares Close 0.8% Lower On Pre-Holiday Slowness \b0\par\par\uc2 284 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Dezember 1996\par 16:07\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  ISTANBUL (AP-Dow Jones)--The Istanbul Stock Exchange main index closed 0.8% lower Monday in slow trading which is attributed to lack of foreign players and unease about Turk Telekom's privatization. \par \par \uc2  The main Istanbul Stock Exchange IMKB-100 index closed at 94,107.12 points, down 772 points from Friday's 94,879.14 points. Trading volume was at 12.9 trillion lira, down from 18.9 trillion lira. \par \par \uc2  Participants said negative signals from the constitutional court on the Telekom's privatization is worrying the market. The court is debating the Telekom privatization law but doesn't have a fixed date of rule announcement. Participants said a negative rule will cause serious harm to the market. \par \par \uc2  Also, the Christmas holiday is seen to slow foreign participants' presence. \par \par \uc2  A local trader said the index's intraday high of 96,158 points was short lived because of profit taking, and because of rumors in the market that some investors switched to buying dollars for speculation. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday afternoon by selling dollars at 106,600, lira as \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders observed a dollar buying demand. \par \par \uc2  While some expect the index this week to move towards the psychological barrier of 100,000 points, some participants said it will be trapped between 94,000 and 96,000 points. \par \par \uc2  Some of the active shares Monday were paint company CBS Boya, at 2,450 lira, up 325 lira or 15%; Bisas Textile, at 8,000 lira, up 900 lira or 13%; and Yasas paint, at 7,300 lira, up 200 lira or 3%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 23-12-96 \par \par \uc2  1507GMT \par \par \uc2  5070 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dscn01zl8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
