\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Turkey \highlight\uc2  Lira Stable Vs Dlr Following Bank  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 270 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Dezember 1996\par 10:36\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  ISTANBUL (AP-Dow Jones)--The Turkish lira is stable against the dollar Wednesday following Tuesday's heavy dollar selling by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Traders said the effects of Tuesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  are still felt, as banks' dollar bids are below Tuesday's quotes and slow lira depreciation means there is better return at the lira interest rates. \par \par \uc2  'The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will buy dollars with the low rate Wednesday and replenish its reserves,' said an Istanbul trader. \par \par \uc2  Around 0915 GMT, the dollar bids at the dollar/lira interbank market were at 103,900 lira, down from Tuesday's post-\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  close of 104,020 lira. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar buying rate for commercial banks' minimum reserves were at 103,900 lira, up from Wednesday's opening at 103,850 lira. \par \par \uc2  Around 0822 GMT, the dollar was quoted at 1.5458 marks, higher than 1.5447 marks earlier in Asia, but down from 1.5531 marks late Tuesday in New York. \par \par \uc2  Traders said bank customers might still want to buy dollars because of their year-end requirements, but there is no room for speculative dollar buying due to \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  presence in the market. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates currently indicate a maximum of a 5% monthly lira depreciation against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket for December, they said. This corresponds to a 55% foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  return versus a 77% lira interest rate return, they added. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  gauges the lira's depreciation against a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket of 1 dollar and 1.5 marks. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 11-12-96 \par \par \uc2  0936GMT \par \par \uc2  1169 1862 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dscb01lou\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
