\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Turkey Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Seen  \highlight22\uc2 Intervening \highlight\uc2  More Wed: Amplifier \b0\par\par\uc2  By Selim Atalay \par \uc2 255 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 November 1996\par 22:29\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  ISTANBUL (AP-Dow Jones)--Wednesday should bring more \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but that won't keep the Turkish lira from falling more against the dollar, Istanbul traders said. \par \par \uc2  As expected, at Tuesday's 182-day bill auction, the Turkish Treasury failed to roll over the full 135 trillion lira of debt maturing Wednesday by issuing new bills. \par \par \uc2  As a result, the market will open Wednesday flush with 100 trillion lira from the repayment, fueling a fresh round of dollar-buying, market players said. Excess liquidity has in the past been channelled into the dollar. \par \par \uc2  As reported, the Turkish \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday, as it did for most of last week, to support the lira. \par \par \uc2  'The market was anxious already and this will continue Wednesday,' said Meltem Bileydi, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at Yapi ve Kredi Bankasi in Istanbul. 'The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  aggressively.' \par \par \uc2  Traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  tries to keep the lira's daily depreciation against its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket at 0.2% to 0.25% and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  by selling dollars when this accelerates. The bank's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket is a weighted average of $1.00 and 1.5 Deutsche marks. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was closed when the Treasury auction results were announced Tuesday afternoon, but the dollar was bid in the interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for next-day settlement at 99,530 lira, up from Tuesday's close at 99,325 lira. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 19-11-96 \par \par \uc2  2129GMT \par \par \uc2  1192 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dsbj0125q\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (Turkey near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clverta